      "index": "aO",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 682034,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 36935513,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792643480947,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "曲线只剩 r 枚，你的 amountIn 买得比 r 还多：\n合约只收买完 r 枚所需的 amountInUsed，\n给你全部 r 枚，状态 → Completed。\n\nnetNeeded = ⌈k / (vT − r)⌉ − vQ\namountInUsed = ⌈netNeeded × 10000 / 9900⌉\n\nfork 实测：剩余 2,015,113.1 枚，\n正好收 6.060607 mUSD（手续费 0.060607）",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "曲线只剩 r 枚，你的 amountIn 买得比 r 还多：\n合约只收买完 r 枚所需的 amountInUsed，\n给你全部 r 枚，状态 → Completed。\n\nnetNeeded = ⌈k / (vT − r)⌉ − vQ\namountInUsed = ⌈netNeeded × 10000 / 9900⌉\n\nfork 实测：剩余 2,015,113.1 枚，\n正好收 6.060607 mUSD（手续费 0.060607）",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.45
    },
    {
      "id": "t-88",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 910,
      "y": 404,
      "width": 305.8984375,
      "height": 92.8,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#B8C6BE",
